{
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to use this dashboard",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### While the test is running\nWatch the **big numbers** and the **lines**. Green = healthy. Red error-rate = above 1%.\n\n### After the test is over\n1. Set the time picker (top right) to **cover the whole run** (e.g. Last 1 hour, or a custom range).\n2. Read the **yellow “This run (selected window)”** row — Peak users, peak RPS, typical error %, slowest p95.\n3. For the **client / sign-off summary** (every endpoint, PASS/FAIL), use the **HTML report** from GitHub Actions artifacts — Grafana is the live/engineering view, not the signed client report.\n\n**Why you used to see 40× “HTTP failed”:** k6 tags every URL separately. Those 100% lines were *one URL’s failed series*, not the whole test. Queries below are **aggregated to one number / one line**."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "This run (selected time window) — set the clock to the full test first",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "id": 20,
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Peak concurrent users",
      "description": "Highest VU count in the selected time range. For a 600-user test this should be ~600 (not the last value after ramp-down).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "id": 21,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "max_over_time(max(k6_vus)[$__range:])", "refId": "A", "legendFormat": "Peak VUs" }],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue" }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "" },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Peak requests / sec",
      "description": "Busiest minute in the selected window.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 6 },
      "id": 22,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "max_over_time(sum(rate(k6_http_reqs_total[1m]))[$__range:])", "refId": "A", "legendFormat": "Peak RPS" }],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 1,
          "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "purple" }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "" },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Error rate (window avg)",
      "description": "Average overall HTTP fail rate in the window. Target: below 1%.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 6 },
      "id": 23,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "avg_over_time((sum(rate(k6_http_req_failed_count[1m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(k6_http_reqs_total[1m])), 0.001))[$__range:])", "refId": "A", "legendFormat": "Avg fail %" }],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.005 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.01 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "" },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Slowest overall p95 (window)",
      "description": "Highest overall p95 latency seen in the window (milliseconds).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 6 },
      "id": 24,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "max_over_time(max(k6_http_req_duration_p95)[$__range:])", "refId": "A", "legendFormat": "Max p95" }],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1500 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 3000 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "" },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Live now (or last sample in the window)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 11 },
      "id": 25,
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Users right now",
      "description": "After ramp-down this goes to 0. Use Peak concurrent users above for the 50/600 number.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 12 },
      "id": 2,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "max(k6_vus)", "refId": "A", "legendFormat": "VUs now" }],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "" },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Requests / sec now",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 12 },
      "id": 3,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "sum(rate(k6_http_reqs_total[1m]))", "refId": "A", "legendFormat": "RPS" }],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "decimals": 1 }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "" },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "HTTP error rate now",
      "description": "One overall number (all URLs combined). Target below 1%.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 12 },
      "id": 4,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "sum(rate(k6_http_req_failed_count[1m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(k6_http_reqs_total[1m])), 0.001)", "refId": "A", "legendFormat": "Fail %" }],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.005 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.01 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "" },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Latency p95 now",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 12 },
      "id": 5,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "max(k6_http_req_duration_p95)", "refId": "A", "legendFormat": "p95" }],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1500 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 3000 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "" },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Users over time (one line)",
      "description": "Ramp up → hold at target → ramp down to 0.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
      "id": 6,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "max(k6_vus)", "refId": "A", "legendFormat": "Concurrent users" }],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 20 }
        }
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true } }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "API traffic (one line)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 16 },
      "id": 7,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "sum(rate(k6_http_reqs_total[1m]))", "refId": "A", "legendFormat": "Requests / sec" }],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 15 }
        }
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true } }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Overall error rate (one line — all APIs together)",
      "description": "This is the number that matters. Individual URLs are not listed.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 24 },
      "id": 8,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "sum(rate(k6_http_req_failed_count[1m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(k6_http_reqs_total[1m])), 0.001)", "refId": "A", "legendFormat": "HTTP failed (all APIs)" },
        { "expr": "avg(k6_application_error_rate)", "refId": "B", "legendFormat": "Application errors" },
        { "expr": "avg(k6_transport_error_rate)", "refId": "C", "legendFormat": "Timeouts / network" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 0.05,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2 },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.01 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true } }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Session health (one line each)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 24 },
      "id": 9,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "avg(k6_journey_success_rate)", "refId": "A", "legendFormat": "Full journey OK" },
        { "expr": "avg(k6_heartbeat_success_rate)", "refId": "B", "legendFormat": "Heartbeat OK" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0.9,
          "max": 1,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2 }
        }
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true } }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latency p95 by area (one line per product area)",
      "description": "Venue / music / events / social / chat — not one line per URL.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 32 },
      "id": 10,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "max by (api_group) (k6_http_req_duration_p95{api_group=~\"venue|music|events|social|chat\"})", "refId": "A", "legendFormat": "{{api_group}}" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 5 },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1500 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 3000 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"], "showLegend": true } }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Overall latency — p95 and p99 (two lines only)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 41 },
      "id": 11,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "max(k6_http_req_duration_p95)", "refId": "A", "legendFormat": "p95 (all APIs)" },
        { "expr": "max(k6_http_req_duration_p99)", "refId": "B", "legendFormat": "p99 (all APIs)" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2 }
        }
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true } }
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "10s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "style": "dark",
  "tags": ["niteout", "k6", "performance"],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "label": "Prometheus",
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "time": { "from": "now-1h", "to": "now" },
  "timepicker": {},
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "NiteOut k6 — Live Load Test",
  "uid": "niteout-k6-overview",
  "version": 3,
  "description": "Aggregated live view + peak stats for the selected time range. Client sign-off = HTML report."
}
